{"id":"3cc288e6d7752bb4","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-substitution.md","title":"GL Substitution","display":"df-gl-substitution — GL Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-substitution","aliases":["89-df-gl-substitution"],"display":"df-gl-substitution — GL Substitution","depends_on":["[[89-df-substitution-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-substitution — GL Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> are the variable and formula sets.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[p:=B]\">\\(A[p:=B]\\)</span> is structural modal substitution (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" href=\"?note=48f7a8aeae4eecb4\" title=\"89-df-substitution-modal\">89-df-substitution-modal</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\mathrm{GL}}:(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\times\\mathrm{Prop}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box})\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\mathrm{GL}}:(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\times\\mathrm{Prop}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box})\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是下述给出的结构替换函数图，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为该接口的系统下标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((A,p,B),A[p:=B]\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((A,p,B),A[p:=B]\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是结构替换函数的图；它没有把“GL 对替换封闭”偷放进定义。</li>\n<li>替换保持 GL 定理性是后续 substitution lemma，而不是此关系定义的结果。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-substitution-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-substitution-modal","status":"resolved","id":"48f7a8aeae4eecb4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A[p:=B]$ is structural modal substitution (see [[89-df-substitution-modal]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"A[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\mathrm{GL}}:(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\times\\mathrm{Prop}\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box})\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\n\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((A,p,B),A[p:=B]\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\nA,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\land p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\n\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1079,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-303","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["48f7a8aeae4eecb4"]}